{"ref":"BDB, שְׁאָגָה","hw":"שְׁאָגָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאָגָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. roaring</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  like lion, abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.29\">Is 5:29</a> (of invaders); of lion, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲגַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.3\">Zc 11:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 4:10\" href=\"/Job.4.10\">Jb 4:10</a> (fig. of wicked), sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל שַׁאֲגָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.7\">Ez 19:7</a> (fig. of conquering king).<br><strong>2.</strong>  human cry in distress, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲגָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 32:3\" href=\"/Psalms.32.3\">ψ 32:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבְרֵי שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:2\" href=\"/Psalms.22.2\">22:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁאֲגֹתָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:24\" href=\"/Job.3.24\">Jb 3:24</a>.","next":"BDB, שֹׁאָה","prev":"BDB, שָׁאַג"}